{"hymn":"FR229","parent":"E233","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Oh ! quel miracle ! Mon Seigneur","syl":{"n1":["Oh!",null],"n2":["quel",null],"n3":["mi","i"],"n4":["ra","m"],"n5":["cle!","t"],"n6":["Mon",null],"n7":["Sei","i"],"n8":["gneur,","t"],"n9":["Que",null],"n10":["l’homme",null],"n11":["et",null],"n12":["Di","i"],"n14":["eu","t"],"n16":["sont",null],"n17":["vraiment",null],"n18":["un;",null],"n19":["Je",null],"n20":["suis",null],"n21":["en",null],"n22":["Toi,",null],"n23":["Tu",null],"n24":["es",null],"n26":["en",null],"n28":["moi:",null],"n29":["Ce",null],"n30":["grand",null],"n31":["mys","i"],"n32":["tère","t"],"n33":["est",null],"n34":["ré","i"],"n35":["vé","m"],"n36":["lé!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Grâce à Ton corps livré pour moi,","Je prends part à Toi maintenant ;","Seigneur, Ton sang précieux coula,","De mes péchés me libéra."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["En résurrection Tu changeas","De forme, devenant l’Esprit ;","De Tes richesses rassasié,","De Toi je serai saturé."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Quand ces symboles nous voyons","Nous discernons Ton grand amour,","Te rendons grâces pour Ton plan","Et Tes souffrances contemplons."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Nous prenons part au pain, au vin,","Vers Ta douceur Tu nous conduits.","En esprit nous Te recevons,","Nos esprits sont de Toi nourris."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Boire et manger plus en esprit","Est notre plus ardent désir,","Qu’en saturant notre être entier,","Tu obtiennes un vrai souvenir."]}]}